        "description": "<h2>TERMS &amp; CONDITIONS</h2>\n<p><strong>Last Updated: [21 July 2025]</strong></p>\n<p>These Terms &amp; Conditions (\"Terms\") govern your access to and use of the website, mobile applications, products, and services operated by Hamaragharr Vastu Corporation (\"Hamaragharr\", \"we\", \"us\", \"our\"). By accessing, browsing, or purchasing from our platform, you agree to be legally bound by these Terms. If you do not agree with any part of these Terms, please do not use our website or services.</p>\n\n<h3>1. ABOUT HAMARAGHARR</h3>\n<p>Hamaragharr is a Vastu-focused brand offering Vastu kits, paintings, physical products, guidance material, and advisory-based spiritual products inspired by traditional Vastu Shastra. Our offerings are intended to support energy balance, harmony, and well-being in living and working spaces. Hamaragharr does not provide medical, legal, financial, or clinical advice.</p>\n\n<h3>2. ACCEPTANCE OF TERMS</h3>\n<p>By using this website or purchasing any product or service, you:</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Confirm that you are at least 18 years of age</li>\n<li>Confirm that you are legally capable of entering into a binding contract under Indian law</li>\n<li>Agree to comply with these Terms, our Privacy Policy, Shipping Policy, and Return, Exchange &amp; Refund Policy</li>\n</ul>\n<p>Continued use of the platform constitutes acceptance of any updates made to these Terms.</p>\n\n<h3>3. NATURE OF SERVICES &amp; DISCLAIMER</h3>\n<ul>\n<li>All Vastu-related content, products, remedies, guidance books, kits, videos, or recommendations provided by Hamaragharr are spiritual, traditional, and informational in nature.</li>\n<li>Results may vary from person to person and from space to space.</li>\n<li>We do not guarantee specific outcomes, transformations, or results.</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>Important Disclaimer:</strong> Hamaragharr does not substitute professional medical, psychological, legal, or financial advice. You should consult qualified professionals for such matters.</p>\n\n<h3>4. EMERGENCY DISCLAIMER</h3>\n<p>Hamaragharr is not a crisis support platform. If you are experiencing:</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Severe emotional distress</li>\n<li>Thoughts of self-harm or harm to others</li>\n<li>A medical or psychological emergency</li>\n</ul>\n<p>Please immediately contact local emergency services or a suicide prevention helpline. Use of our platform in such situations is entirely at your own risk.</p>\n\n<h3>5. USER REGISTRATION &amp; ACCOUNT RESPONSIBILITY</h3>\n<ul>\n<li>You may be required to provide accurate and complete information while placing an order or creating an account.</li>\n<li>You are solely responsible for maintaining the confidentiality of your login credentials.</li>\n<li>You are responsible for all activities conducted through your account.</li>\n</ul>\n<p>Hamaragharr reserves the right to suspend or terminate accounts that provide false, misleading, or incomplete information.</p>\n\n<h3>6. PRODUCTS, ORDERS &amp; PAYMENTS</h3>\n<ul>\n<li>Prices, product descriptions, and availability are subject to change without notice.</li>\n<li>Product images are for illustrative purposes only. Minor variations may occur.</li>\n<li>By placing an order, you agree to pay the full amount including applicable taxes and shipping charges.</li>\n</ul>\n<p>Payment processing is handled through third-party payment gateways. Hamaragharr is not responsible for payment gateway failures or unauthorized access beyond its control.</p>\n\n<h3>7. SHIPPING, RETURNS &amp; REFUNDS</h3>\n<p>All shipping, return, exchange, and refund matters are governed by our Shipping Policy and Return, Exchange &amp; Refund Policy, which form an integral part of these Terms. Please review them carefully before making a purchase.</p>\n\n<h3>8. USER CONDUCT &amp; PROHIBITED ACTIVITIES</h3>\n<p>You agree not to:</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Misuse the website or its content</li>\n<li>Post or transmit unlawful, abusive, defamatory, obscene, or harmful